home='''<section class="hero"><img class="hero-photo" src="/assets/northern-california.webp" alt="Northern California waterway and suspension bridge at dusk" fetchpriority="high"><div class="hero-shade"></div><div class="hero-content wrap"><p class="eyebrow light">PRIVATE INVESTIGATIONS / FAIRFIELD, CALIFORNIA</p><h1>When the decision<br>matters, <em>dig deeper.</em></h1><p>Thorough background investigations. Experienced judgment. A clearer path forward for the people responsible for making the call.</p><div class="button-row">'''+btn()+btn('Explore our approach','/about/','button outline')+'''</div></div><div class="hero-bottom wrap"><span>BREAK POINT INVESTIGATIONS</span><span>DISCRETION. DILIGENCE. CLARITY.</span></div></section><div class="credibility wrap"><div><strong>24 years</strong><span>Law-enforcement experience¹</span></div><div><strong>DJ Watts</strong><span>Owner &amp; operator</span></div><div><strong>PI188952</strong><span>California PI license number</span></div></div><section class="wrap section intro-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE RIGHT INFORMATION CHANGES EVERYTHING</p><h2>Uncertainty should not<br>make the decision for you.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">An application tells one part of a story. A careful investigation helps you understand the rest.</p><p>Break Point Investigations brings experienced, personal attention to background investigations and investigative inquiries. Based in Fairfield, DJ Watts helps agencies ask better questions, connect relevant information, and move toward an informed decision.</p>'''+btn('Meet DJ Watts','/about/','text-link')+'''</div></section><section class="soft section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-title-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">FOCUSED INVESTIGATIVE SERVICES</p><h2>Depth where it counts.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/services/">Explore services ↗</a></div>'''+services+'''</div></section><section class="split-feature"><div class="feature-image"><img src="/assets/casework.webp" alt="Organized case folders and research notebook on a desk" loading="lazy"><span>THOUGHTFUL WORK. INFORMED DECISIONS.</span></div><div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">FOR PUBLIC-SAFETY AGENCIES</p><h2>The person behind<br>the application.</h2><p>Hiring for a position of trust calls for more than a surface-level check. Explore an approach built around relevant records, employment history, references, and careful follow-up.</p>'''+btn('Background investigations','/background-investigations/','button dark')+'''</div></section><section class="wrap section">'''+heading('A CLEAR PATH FORWARD','From your first question<br>to the next informed step.','Know how the work begins before you commit.')+process+'''</section><section class="region"><div class="wrap region-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow light">ROOTED IN NORTHERN CALIFORNIA</p><h2>Local perspective.<br>Professional reach.</h2><p>Based in Fairfield, at the connection between Solano County, the Bay Area, and the Sacramento region. Ask DJ about coverage for your assignment.</p>'''+btn('Discuss your location','/contact/','button outline')+'''</div><div class="region-art" aria-label="Illustrative Northern California service region"><svg viewBox="0 0 460 360" role="img"><title>Illustrative regional connections around Fairfield</title><path d="M65 320 140 190 200 170 240 70 360 40M140 190 330 240M200 170 385 125M240 70 385 125" fill="none" stroke="#587178" stroke-width="1"/><g fill="none" stroke="#b9a584"><circle cx="200" cy="170" r="90"/><circle cx="200" cy="170" r="130" opacity=".3"/></g><g fill="#d3bea0"><circle cx="200" cy="170" r="6"/><circle cx="140" cy="190" r="3"/><circle cx="240" cy="70" r="3"/><circle cx="360" cy="40" r="3"/><circle cx="330" cy="240" r="3"/></g><g fill="#fff" font-family="Arial" font-size="12"><text x="216" y="164">FAIRFIELD</text><text x="75" y="215">BAY AREA</text><text x="253" y="69">SACRAMENTO REGION</text><text x="320" y="266">CONTRA COSTA</text></g></svg><small>REGIONAL ILLUSTRATION · COVERAGE BY AGREEMENT</small></div></div></section><section class="wrap section"><div class="faq-grid">'''+heading('BEFORE YOU REACH OUT','A few useful answers.','A straightforward start for an important conversation.')+faq(faqs)+'''</div></section>'''+cta
services_page='''<section class="page-hero wrap"><p class="eyebrow">OUR SERVICES</p><h1>Better questions.<br><em>Deeper understanding.</em></h1><p class="lead">Background investigations and focused investigative support, with a clear purpose from the start.</p></section><section class="wrap section no-top">'''+services+'''</section><section class="split-feature" id="research"><div class="feature-image"><img src="/assets/casework.webp" alt="Case research materials arranged on a desk"></div><div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH &amp; INTERVIEWS</p><h2>Context makes<br>the difference.</h2><p>Break Point's background investigation approach includes reference development, employment and residential history, and coordination with prior agencies when relevant. The assignment determines what needs to be examined.</p><p>Discuss your objectives with DJ to confirm available services, authorization, and how findings should support your decision.</p>'''+btn('Discuss an assignment','/contact/','button dark')+'''</div></section><section class="wrap section"><div class="intro-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">PRIVATE INVESTIGATION IN FAIRFIELD, CA</p><h2>Define the need.<br>Then define the work.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">Every inquiry deserves an appropriate scope.</p><p>Whether you represent a public-safety agency or are exploring an investigative need, your first conversation establishes what you are trying to learn. DJ will discuss fit, available resources, timing, and the next steps.</p><p>Assignments outside the firm's confirmed scope can be discussed directly. Service availability and geographic coverage are determined case by case.</p></div></div></section>'''+cta
background='''<section class="background-banner"><img src="/assets/casework.webp" alt="Neatly arranged investigative casework materials"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow light">PRE-EMPLOYMENT BACKGROUND INVESTIGATIONS</p><h1>Positions of trust<br>deserve <em>a closer look.</em></h1><p>Give your agency a more complete understanding of the people you are considering.</p>'''+btn('Discuss agency needs')+'''</div></section><section class="wrap section intro-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">PUBLIC-SAFETY HIRING</p><h2>More context.<br>Fewer unanswered questions.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">A background investigation connects the application to the person's history.</p><p>Break Point Investigations supports pre-employment background investigations for sworn personnel and professional staff. DJ's published agency proposal describes work involving prior agencies, references, employment history, and residential history.</p><p>The engagement begins with your agency's requirements, the candidate population, and the information needed for a considered hiring decision.</p></div></section><section class="soft section"><div class="wrap">'''+heading('THE INVESTIGATIVE LENS','Follow the history.<br>Develop the context.','The scope is tailored to your agency and assignment.')+'''<div class="four-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Employment history</h3><p>Explore prior work experience and relevant employer information within the agreed scope.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>References &amp; follow-up</h3><p>Speak with references and develop additional leads to better understand the applicant's history.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Residential history</h3><p>Examine relevant residential information as one part of a fuller background picture.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Prior agency coordination</h3><p>Coordinate with prior agencies when applicable, including for lateral candidates.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="wrap section intro-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">EXPERIENCE WITH AGENCY NEEDS</p><h2>Understand the standard.<br>Respect the responsibility.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">DJ's agency proposal identifies 24 years of law-enforcement experience, including service as a Contra Costa Sheriff's Office lieutenant and Richmond police officer.</p><p>The proposal describes conducting background investigations in accordance with P.O.S.T. standards. Discuss the requirements that apply to your agency, current scope, and deliverables directly with DJ.</p><a class="text-link" href="'''+RICH+'''" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the publicly available agency proposal ↗</a><p class="fine">Public record provided for context. It does not imply an agency endorsement.</p></div></section><section class="wrap section no-top">'''+heading('WORKING TOGETHER','Start with your hiring needs.','Share the role types, anticipated volume, location, and target timeline. Please arrange a suitable records exchange before providing sensitive applicant information.')+process+'''</section>'''+cta
about='''<section class="page-hero wrap"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT BREAK POINT</p><h1>Experience that knows<br><em>where to look.</em></h1><p class="lead">A personal approach to careful investigation, led by Delvin J. Watts.</p></section><section class="wrap about-grid"><div class="identity-panel"><div class="monogram">DJ<span>WATTS</span></div><p>DELVIN J. WATTS</p><h2>Owner.<br>Operator.<br>Investigator.</h2><div class="panel-line"></div><span>BREAK POINT INVESTIGATIONS<br>FAIRFIELD, CALIFORNIA<br>LICENSE #PI188952</span></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="eyebrow">MEET DJ WATTS</p><h2>Seasoned perspective.<br>Direct accountability.</h2><p class="lead">When you contact Break Point Investigations, you can reach the person responsible for the work.</p><p>Delvin J. Watts, known as DJ, is the owner and operator of Break Point Investigations. His agency proposal identifies 24 years of law-enforcement experience, including a retired lieutenant role with the Contra Costa Sheriff's Office and police service with the Richmond Police Department.</p><p>That experience informs a practical approach to background investigations: understand the assignment, follow relevant information, and develop the context needed for a better decision.</p>'''+btn('Connect with DJ','/contact/','button dark')+'''</div></section><section class="wrap section"><div class="section-title-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE WAY WE WORK</p><h2>Thoughtful at every step.</h2></div></div><div class="steps"><article><span>01 / DISCRETION</span><h3>Respect the information.</h3><p>Begin with a limited inquiry and agree on how sensitive materials should be exchanged.</p></article><article><span>02 / DILIGENCE</span><h3>Follow what matters.</h3><p>Bring focus to records, references, and the questions relevant to your assignment.</p></article><article><span>03 / CLARITY</span><h3>Keep the purpose in view.</h3><p>Set expectations around scope, communication, and how the work supports your decision.</p></article></div></section><section class="soft section"><div class="wrap intro-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">PUBLIC RECORDS &amp; BUSINESS INFORMATION</p><h2>Background you<br>can explore.</h2><p>Learn more through public agency records and independent business resources.</p></div><div class="resource-list"><a href="'''+RICH+'''" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>City of Richmond</strong><span>Background investigation proposal and contract record ↗</span></a><a href="'''+EL+'''" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>City of El Cerrito</strong><span>Public financial record listing background investigation services ↗</span></a><a href="https://search.dca.ca.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>California license lookup</strong><span>Search the license number provided by DJ: PI188952 ↗</span></a><a href="https://www.hiresecuritynow.com/security-companies/california/fairfield" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Fairfield business directory</strong><span>Independent listing for Break Point Investigations ↗</span></a></div></div><p class="wrap fine">Public records are informational and do not represent endorsements. Business contact details and license number are provided in DJ's supplied signature.</p></section>'''+cta
